5
00:00:11,811 --> 00:00:13,195
yesterday afternoon.

6
00:00:13,515 --> 00:00:15,393
So can it win that level back?

7
00:00:15,713 --> 00:00:18,758
Let's take a look, for Saturday 28 November.

8
00:00:20,083 --> 00:00:22,174
So, over the last 24 hours,

9
00:00:22,314 --> 00:00:25,570
Bitcoin touched a high of $62,250,

10
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:29,287
