11
00:00:29,607 --> 00:00:32,465
Right now it's around $59,900.

12
00:00:32,785 --> 00:00:33,845
And look at this.

13
00:00:34,165 --> 00:00:35,270
Since that drop,

14
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:38,926
