15
00:00:39,246 --> 00:00:41,488
So $60,000 is now the ceiling.

16
00:00:42,817 --> 00:00:44,208
Now, quick refresher.

17
00:00:44,528 --> 00:00:46,575
Two markets move Bitcoin's price.

18
00:00:46,895 --> 00:00:49,830
Spot, which is people buying real coins, and futures,

19
00:00:49,970 --> 00:00:51,480
