20
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:54,285
Spot has been only slightly on the sell side,

21
00:00:54,425 --> 00:00:57,048
about $38 million net over the day.

22
00:00:57,368 --> 00:00:59,045
Futures did the heavy lifting,

23
00:00:59,185 --> 00:01:01,322
