24
00:01:01,462 --> 00:01:04,773
close to $1 billion net sold over 24 hours.

25
00:01:05,093 --> 00:01:08,400
And remember, spot is only about 15% of all the volume.

26
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:10,663
So this was a futures-driven drop,

27
00:01:10,803 --> 00:01:13,297
although both markets have ticked up in the last half

28
00:01:13,437 --> 00:01:14,062
hour.

29
00:01:15,383 --> 00:01:17,077
Next up, open interest.

30
00:01:17,397 --> 00:01:20,105
That's the total value of all the open leveraged

31
00:01:20,245 --> 00:01:21,132
positions.

32
00:01:21,452 --> 00:01:23,706
It's down almost 3% over the day,

33
00:01:23,846 --> 00:01:25,699
