37
00:01:32,352 --> 00:01:34,768
Since then it's been flat for about twelve hours.

38
00:01:35,088 --> 00:01:36,953
And funding is still positive,

39
00:01:37,093 --> 00:01:39,119
in the upper half of its weekly range,

40
00:01:39,259 --> 00:01:41,251
