44
00:01:49,774 --> 00:01:52,082
that's more than $1.8 billion,

45
00:01:52,222 --> 00:01:53,949
with BlackRock leading the selling.

46
00:01:54,269 --> 00:01:56,943
The flows for Wednesday and Friday's half-day session

47
00:01:57,083 --> 00:01:58,143
aren't in yet.

48
00:01:58,463 --> 00:02:02,064
And it's the weekend now, so ETFs are closed until Monday,

49
00:02:02,204 --> 00:02:04,502
