50
00:02:05,817 --> 00:02:07,564
So, here's how the levels look.

51
00:02:07,884 --> 00:02:09,713
The big one is $60,000.

52
00:02:10,033 --> 00:02:13,298
If Bitcoin can close an hour above $60,200,

53
00:02:13,438 --> 00:02:16,956
