59
00:02:33,417 --> 00:02:35,289
So, two things to keep an eye on.

60
00:02:35,609 --> 00:02:38,662
Can we get an hourly close above $60,200,

61
00:02:38,802 --> 00:02:41,255
and does spot buying back up the latest bounce?

62
00:02:41,575 --> 00:02:44,176
Let me know in the comments which way you think it breaks.

63
00:02:44,496 --> 00:02:46,832
As always, this isn't financial advice.

64
00:02:47,152 --> 00:02:49,789
Thanks so much for watching, and I'll see you tomorrow!
